{
    "id": "body-metrics@beatlink",
    "name": "Body Metrics",
    "description": "A body measurement log for weight, body fat, waist, chest and any other metric you define with its own unit. Each day holds one reading per metric plus a note, shown beside the previous reading and the change since. Metrics can carry a goal, the reports tab plots any one of them over 30 days to all time with a 7-day moving average and the goal line, beside its latest value, change, lowest, highest and distance to goal, and BMI is worked out from weight when a height is set. Weights and lengths are labelled in kg/lb and cm/in from settings. All data is a single persisted JSON note.",
    "author": "BeatLink",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/Trilium-Community/trilium-scripts/tree/main/addons/body-metrics@beatlink",
    "license": "GPL-3.0-or-later",
